.ui.card
  h2.card-header
    | Enable Beta mode?
  .card-body
    p
      | Beta mode is an experimental mode and may make your IDE unstable. Enable at your own risk.
    p
      | After enabling please reopen all your tabs.
  .card-footer
    input.key-focus style='visibility: hidden'
    .right
      button.ui.btn click='didClickCancel target="view"' Cancel
      button.ui.btn.primary click='didClickOK target="view"' Enable
